Presidential elections were held in [[Moldova]] on 30 October 2016.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.hotnews.ro/stiri-esential-20908466-alegerile-prezidentiale-din-moldova-vor-tine-30-octombrie.htm |title=Alegerile prezidentiale din R. Moldova se vor tine pe 30 octombrie |work=HotNews.ro |author= G. S. |date=1 April 2016}}</ref> They were the first direct presidential elections since [[1996 Moldovan presidential election|1996]] and followed a declaration by the [[Constitutional Court of Moldova|Constitutional Court]] on 4 March 2016 that the 2000 constitutional revision that led to the president being indirectly elected by [[Parliament of the Republic of Moldova|Parliament]] was unconstitutional.<ref>{{cite web |url=http://www.publika.md/curtea-constitutionala-a-decis-presedintele-tarii-va-fi-ales-prin-vot-direct-de-catre-popor-_2551711.html |title=The Constitutional Court of Moldova has decided: the country's president will be directly elected by the people |date=4 March 2016 |publisher=publika.md |accessdate=4 March 2016 |archive-date=8 November 2016 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161108083658/http://www.publika.md/curtea-constitutionala-a-decis-presedintele-tarii-va-fi-ales-prin-vot-direct-de-catre-popor-_2551711.html |url-status=dead }}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=http://unimedia.info/stiri/video-ultima-ora-curtea-constitutionala-presedintele-va-fi-ales-direct-de-popor-110682.html |title=The Constitutional Court: the president will be elected by the people |publisher=Unimedia.info |accessdate=4 March 2016 |archive-date=7 May 2016 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160507210008/http://unimedia.info/stiri/video-ultima-ora-curtea-constitutionala-presedintele-va-fi-ales-direct-de-popor-110682.html |url-status=dead }}</ref> The elections were won by [[Igor Dodon]] of the [[Party of Socialists of the Republic of Moldova]] (PSRM).<ref>{{Cite news |url=http://unimedia.info/stiri/igor-dodon-este-noul-presedinte-al-republicii-moldova-123182.html |title=Igor Dodon este noul președinte al Republicii Moldova |access-date=2016-11-13 |archive-date=2016-11-18 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161118212644/http://unimedia.info/stiri/igor-dodon-este-noul-presedinte-al-republicii-moldova-123182.html |url-status=dead }}</ref><ref name=voa20161113 />

